# A panic raised in a cleanup as its block is left by its end, a `break`, a `continue` or a return leaves the function once the cleanups have run.

watch(1)
watch(2)
watch(3)
watch(4)
watch(5)
-- "end"

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
