way 1: pass 1
cleanup 1
cleanup 2
way 2: pass 2
cleanup 1
cleanup 2
block
way 3: at the end of a block
cleanup 1
cleanup 2
way 4: at the return
cleanup 1
cleanup 2
block
left 2
end
